# Kakuro: the digit chooser, a wrong board, clearing, restart and solving.
expect Cross sums · 0 of 105 solved
tap Kakuro
tap Three blanks
wait-for-id game-more
expect Starter · Three blanks
expect Row 2, column 3, blank square
expect Restart
# Tapping a square shows both of its sums and the nine digits.
tap-id kakuro-0
expect Enter a digit
expect Across 4 · Down 7
expect Clear square
clean
shot kakuro-entry
# Board leaves without changing the square.
tap Board
expect Row 2, column 3, blank square
tap-id kakuro-0
tap-id digit-5
expect Row 2, column 3, digit 5
tap-id kakuro-1
tap-id digit-2
tap-id kakuro-2
tap-id digit-2
expect Every square is filled, but a sum is wrong or a digit repeats.
clean
shot kakuro-wrong
# Clear square empties it again.
tap-id kakuro-0
tap-id digit-0
expect Row 2, column 3, blank square
# Restart at the foot asks first and can be undone.
tap-id restart
expect Clear this puzzle?
expect Other puzzles keep their progress. You can undo this restart.
clean
shot kakuro-restart-confirm
tap Keep playing
expect Row 3, column 2, digit 2
tap-id restart
tap-id confirm-restart
expect Row 3, column 2, blank square
tap-id game-undo
expect Row 3, column 2, digit 2
# The right digits solve it.
tap-id kakuro-0
tap-id digit-3
tap-id kakuro-2
tap-id digit-4
expect Solved.
expect Next puzzle
clean
shot kakuro-solved
# Progress in another puzzle survives a restart and shows in the list.
tap Next puzzle
wait-for-id game-more
tap-id kakuro-0
tap-id digit-1
restart
wait-for Starter · Puzzle 2
expect Row 2, column 2, digit 1
tap-id 4294967295
expect In progress
expect Solved
clean
shot kakuro-list-after-restart
tap-id 4294967295
expect Cross sums · 1 of 105 solved
